DETAIL:  drop cascades to user mapping for vfdw on server fx_srv
drop cascades to foreign table fx
drop cascades to foreign table fx_packed
drop cascades to foreign table fx_ks
drop cascades to foreign table fx_one
drop cascades to foreign table fx_one_packed
